Day 08 — Introduction to Docker and CI/CD Pipelines
🔹 Ansible — Install Docker Compose
- name: Install Docker Compose
  hosts: all
  become: yes
  tasks:
    - name: Install dependencies
      yum:
        name: "python3-pip"
        state: present
    - name: Install docker-compose
      pip:
        name: docker-compose


